 "valuation": {
  "name": "Valuation calculator",
  "items": [
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.1",
    "kind": "Small label",
    "text": "Valuation calculator"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.2",
    "kind": "Section headline",
    "text": "How would buyers value <em>your business?</em>"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.3",
    "kind": "Paragraph",
    "text": "Most owners have blind spots about what their business is worth. Answer ten questions and see the range a buyer would start from, in about a minute."
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.4",
    "kind": "List item",
    "text": "<b>1</b>Your business"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.5",
    "kind": "List item",
    "text": "<b>2</b>About you"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.6",
    "kind": "List item",
    "text": "<b>3</b>Your range"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.7",
    "kind": "Form label",
    "text": "Last twelve months revenue"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.8",
    "kind": "Form label",
    "text": "Last twelve months adjusted earnings"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.9",
    "kind": "Text",
    "text": "Adjusted earnings is adjusted EBITDA: profit before interest, tax, depreciation and amortization, with your own pay above a market salary and one-time costs added back."
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.10",
    "kind": "Form label",
    "text": "What you sell"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.11",
    "kind": "Form label",
    "text": "Yearly earnings growth, last three years"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.12",
    "kind": "Form label",
    "text": "Your industry, optional"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.13",
    "kind": "Form label",
    "text": "Your sector, optional"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.14",
    "kind": "Form label",
    "text": "Revenue that is repeat or recurring"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.15",
    "kind": "Form label",
    "text": "Revenue from your five largest customers"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.16",
    "kind": "Form label",
    "text": "Do you sell to a highly regulated industry"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.17",
    "kind": "Form label",
    "text": "Your plans for your own role after a sale"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.18",
    "kind": "Button",
    "text": "Next"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.19",
    "kind": "Form label",
    "text": "Company name"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.20",
    "kind": "Form label",
    "text": "Your role"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.21",
    "kind": "Form label",
    "text": "First name"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.22",
    "kind": "Form label",
    "text": "Last name"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.23",
    "kind": "Form label",
    "text": "Work email"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.24",
    "kind": "Form label",
    "text": "Mobile number, optional"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.25",
    "kind": "Form label",
    "text": "When do you plan to sell"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.26",
    "kind": "Form label",
    "text": "How did you hear about us, optional"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.27",
    "kind": "Text",
    "text": "I agree to receive marketing text messages from Capital Row LLC at the mobile number above, such as market updates and event invitations. Consent is not a condition of any engagement. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out, HELP for help. <a>Privacy Policy</a> and <a>SMS Terms</a>."
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.28",
    "kind": "Paragraph",
    "text": "When you press Calculate, your answers and details come to Capital Row, so that we can follow up. <a>Privacy Policy</a>."
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.29",
    "kind": "Button",
    "text": "Previous"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.30",
    "kind": "Button",
    "text": "Calculate"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.31",
    "kind": "Small label",
    "text": "What a buyer will look at"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.32",
    "kind": "Small label",
    "text": "What moves the range"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.33",
    "kind": "Paragraph",
    "text": "A buyer prices the earnings it can support with documents. Every added-back item you cannot document comes off your earnings before any multiple is applied. A Pre-Market Assessment traces your numbers to source documents before a buyer does."
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.34",
    "kind": "Button",
    "text": "Book a consultation"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.35",
    "kind": "Paragraph",
    "text": "Twenty minutes, confidential, on a Pre-Market Assessment for your business. <a>Request a Pre-Market Assessment</a>"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.36",
    "kind": "Text",
    "text": "Your earnings or your revenue"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.37",
    "kind": "Paragraph",
    "text": "Services businesses are priced on adjusted earnings. Software is usually priced on revenue."
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.38",
    "kind": "Text",
    "text": "Published medians"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.39",
    "kind": "Paragraph",
    "text": "Three named, dated figures for your kind of business, from Pepperdine, IBBA and M&A Source, and Software Equity Group."
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.40",
    "kind": "Text",
    "text": "Your range"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.41",
    "kind": "Paragraph",
    "text": "From the lowest reading to the highest. A buyer sets the price after diligence of your records."
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.42",
    "kind": "Button",
    "text": "Change my answers"
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.43",
    "kind": "Note",
    "text": "The range is an educational estimate from your own answers and published medians. It is not a valuation, an appraisal or an offer, and it is not financial, tax or legal advice. It does not account for the specific factors that can change what a buyer pays. For an accurate view, speak with a qualified adviser."
   },
   {
    "key": "sh.valuation.44",
    "kind": "Note",
    "text": "Pepperdine Graziadio Business School, 2026 Private Capital Markets Report, 2 July 2026: investment banker survey, median multiples of recast EBITDA by size band, business services. IBBA and M&A Source, Market Pulse, Q2 2026: median multiple at $5M to $50M of enterprise value. Software Equity Group, Q2 2026 SaaS M&A and Public Market Report, 5 August 2026: enterprise value to trailing revenue, the median and the average SaaS transaction and the listed SaaS index median. Each figure is for its own size band and period, not a figure for your business."
   }
  ]
